i (Business Head of Create and Collab at All About Music) on Project Management and Conducting IP with the School of Music Students[\\/vc_column_text][\\/vc_column][\\/vc_row]<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false}},{\"id\":47618,\"slug\":\"corporate-information\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.whistlingwoods.net\\/corporate-information\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Corporate Information\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<div class=\\\"wpb-content-wrapper\\\" id=\\\"wpb-content-root\\\">\n<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>[\\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text el_class=&#8221;news-media-title&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1660903433071{background-color: #ffffff !important;}&#8221;][\\/vc_column_text][\\/vc_column][\\/vc_row]<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>[vc_row full_width=&#8221;stretch_row&#8221; bg_type=&#8221;image&#8221; parallax_style=&#8221;vcpb-default&#8221; bg_image_repeat=&#8221;no-repeat&#8221; el_id=&#8221;about&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1644570531208{padding-bottom: 30px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1644570413984{padding-top: 4px !important;padding-bottom: 4px !important;background-color: #ffffff !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1660904059966{margin-top: 10px !important;margin-right: 15px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;background-color: #ffffff !important;}&#8221;] CORPORATE INFORMATION [\\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1767591085300{margin-top: 15px !important;margin-right: 10px !important;margin-bottom: 25px !important;margin-left: 10px !important;background-color: #ffffff !important;}&#8221;]Annual Return Form No. MGT-7 Annual Return 2024-25 Form No. MGT-7 Annual Return 2023-24 Form&hellip;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false}},{\"id\":46605,\"slug\":\"a-day-of-celebrating-legacy-new-beginnings-whistling-woods-international-hosts-the-class-of-2024-annual-convocation\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.whistlingwoods.net\\/do-what-you-love\\/events\\/a-day-of-celebrating-legacy-new-beginnings-whistling-woods-international-hosts-the-class-of-2024-annual-convocation\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"A Day of Celebrating Legacy &#038; New Beginnings: Whistling Woods International Hosts the Class of 2024 Annual Convocation\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<div class=\\\"wpb-content-wrapper\\\" id=\\\"wpb-content-root\\\">\n<\\/p>\\n<p>Whistling Woods International (WWI), Asia&#8217;s premier Film, Communication, and Creative Arts institute, recently hosted its Annual Convocation for the Class of 2024, celebrating both legacy and new beginnings.<\\/p>\\n<p>The event recognised over 300 graduating students, applauding their readiness to lead and innovate in the media and entertainment industry.<\\/p>\\n<p>The convocation, held in two sessions, brought together esteemed industry stalwarts, visionary leaders, and graduates, celebrating the confluence of inspiration, education, and legacy.<br \\/>\\nIn the morning session, the institute honored two luminaries of Indian cinema: Javed Akhtar, the celebrated poet, lyricist, and screenwriter, and Pankaj Kapur, the versatile actor and filmmaker. Both were presented with the Maestro Award in recognition of their outstanding contributions to storytelling, cinema, and culture.<\\/p>\\n<p>Expressing his gratitude, Javed Akhtar said, \\u201cLet there be power in your waves. Let there be determination. You lose the day you stop flowing, the day you give up, so keep going and that&#8217;s the only way to succeed.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>Pankaj Kapur, reflecting on the significance of potential, remarked, &#8220;A wild river, when channelised, has the power to generate electricity. Similarly, through your training at Whistling Woods International, you have been equipped to harness your potential and transform it into an incredible force of creativity and energy.&#8221;<\\/p>\\n<p>Delivering the keynote address, Ajit Andhare, COO of Viacom18 Studios, spoke about the convergence of creativity and business in an ever-evolving entertainment landscape. He emphasised on the opportunities awaiting young graduates, stating, \\u201cThat spark, that revolution you must keep it alive, when facing rejection. It is a difficult path; you have to keep the fire alive.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>The afternoon session honored Manmohan Shetty, a visionary entrepreneur and producer who redefined the Indian entertainment industry. He was presented with the Maestro Award, acknowledging his trailblazing contributions as a producer and pioneer in cinema and experiential entertainment.<br \\/>\\nGrateful for the recognition, Manmohan Shetty shared his thoughts: \\u201cIt&#8217;s institutions like Whistling Woods International that provide the space and mentorship that turn ideas into reality. Thanks for bringing out new talent every day. Your dedication has made the institute the finest in the country.\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<p>The keynote address by Roshan Abbas, Founder of Encompass and Kommune, encouraged the graduates to embrace storytelling as a powerful medium of change and innovation. Sharing a personal insight, he added, \\u201cIt&#8217;s an incredible time to be in this industry, but strive to be the very best at what you do. Only then will you truly earn the pride of seeing your name roll in the credits, knowing the value of your contribution. When you step out into this world, remember that success here thrives on your creativity, passion, enthusiasm, and unwavering ethics.&#8221;<\\/p>\\n<p>As the convocation drew to a close, Subhash Ghai, Founder &amp; Chairman of Whistling Woods International, addressed the graduating class with words of wisdom and encouragement. Reflecting on the institute\\u2019s journey and legacy, he said, \\u201cEmbrace the evolving world by becoming seekers, inventors, and creators. Adapt to change and harness new technologies to tell your heartfelt stories.&#8221;<\\/p>\\n<p>The convocation marked yet another step in WWI\\u2019s mission to nurture, guide, and inspire the next generation of leaders in media, arts, and communication. With over 300 graduates stepping into the world as confident and skilled professionals, the day was not just a celebration of achievements but also a promise of a brighter and more creative future for the industry.[\\/vc_column_text][\\/vc_column][\\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<style type=\\\"text\\/css\\\" data-type=\\\"wwi_shortcodes-inline-css\\\">.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-2a4779f8684a119a0fe664fe95bc631c .owl-nav a {\\n  width: 36px;\\n  height: 36px;\\n  border-radius: 500px;\\n}\\n.inso-arrow-border-on.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-2a4779f8684a119a0fe664fe95bc631c .owl-nav a:not(:hover):before {\\n  border-width: 0px;\\n}\\n.inso-arrow-hover-border-on.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-2a4779f8684a119a0fe664fe95bc631c .owl-nav a:hover:after {\\n  border-width: 0px;\\n}\\n.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-2a4779f8684a119a0fe664fe95bc631c .owl-nav a.owl-prev {\\n  top: 50%;\\n  transform: translateY(calc(-50% + 0px));\\n  left: -43px;\\n}\\n@media all and (-ms-high-contrast: none) {\\n  .gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-2a4779f8684a119a0fe664fe95bc631c .owl-nav a.owl-prev {\\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\\n    margin-top: 0px;\\n  }\\n}\\n.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-2a4779f8684a119a0fe664fe95bc631c .owl-nav a.owl-prev i {\\n  padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\\n}\\n.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-2a4779f8684a119a0fe664fe95bc631c .owl-nav a.owl-next {\\n  top: 50%;\\n  transform: translateY(calc(-50% + 0px));\\n  right: -43px;\\n}\\n@media all and (-ms-high-contrast: none) {\\n  .gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-2a4779f8684a119a0fe664fe95bc631c .owl-nav a.owl-next {\\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\\n    margin-top: 0px;\\n  }\\n}\\n.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carous