m-ico {\\n  width: 44px;\\n  height: 44px;\\n  line-height: 44px;\\n  border-radius: 100px;\\n  margin: -22px 0 0 -22px;\\n  border-width: 0px;\\n}\\n.inso-icon-bg-on.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-2a4779f8684a119a0fe664fe95bc631c.gallery-shortcode .gallery-zoom-ico {\\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\\n  -webkit-box-shadow: none;\\n  box-shadow: none;\\n}\\n.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-2a4779f8684a119a0fe664fe95bc631c.gallery-shortcode .gallery-zoom-ico > span:before {\\n  font-size: 32px;\\n  line-height: 44px;\\n}\\n.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-2a4779f8684a119a0fe664fe95bc631c.gallery-shortcode .gallery-zoom-ico > span {\\n  color: #ffffff;\\n  background: none;\\n}\\n<\\/style>\n<\\/div>[\\/vc_column][\\/vc_row]<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>[vc_row css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1653283370341{margin-bottom: 30px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_column_text] A Day of Celebrating Legacy &amp; New Beginnings: Whistling Woods International Hosts the Class of 2024 Annual Convocation Maestro Awardees, Javed Akhtar, Pankaj Kapur\\u00a0&amp; Manmohan Shetty, along with Keynote Speakers, Ajit Andhare &amp; Roshan Abbas, Inspire Graduates at WWI\\u2019s\\u00a0Class of 2024\\u00a0Convocation. Whistling Woods International (WWI), Asia&#8217;s premier Film, Communication, and Creative&hellip;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false}},{\"id\":45990,\"slug\":\"october-07-2024-guest-workshop-with-vivin-kuruvilla-promusicals-national-head-sales-marketing-premik-jolly-keyboardist-guitarist-and-composer-on-production-101-with-promusicals-with-the-department-of\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.whistlingwoods.net\\/do-what-you-love\\/workshops\\/october-07-2024-guest-workshop-with-vivin-kuruvilla-promusicals-national-head-sales-marketing-premik-jolly-keyboardist-guitarist-and-composer-on-production-101-with-promusicals-with-the-department-of\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"October 07, 2024: Guest Workshop with Vivin Kuruvilla (ProMusicals National Head- Sales &#038; Marketing) &#038; Premik Jolly (Keyboardist, guitarist, and composer) on Production 101 with ProMusicals with the Department of Music Students\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<div class=\\\"wpb-content-wrapper\\\" id=\\\"wpb-content-root\\\">\n<span style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">We, at the School of Music, had a workshop to update the students about the latest innovations in music production, from cutting-edge hardware controllers to industry-standard plugs. Industry experts conducted a hands-on session on deconstructing a mix and showcasing the best tools to take their productions to the next level.<\\/span>[\\/vc_column_text]<style type=\\\"text\\/css\\\" data-type=\\\"wwi_shortcodes-inline-css\\\">.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-cf4fd856ac53369f3d7a16715d5c4db4 .owl-nav a {\\n  width: 36px;\\n  height: 36px;\\n  border-radius: 500px;\\n}\\n.inso-arrow-border-on.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-cf4fd856ac53369f3d7a16715d5c4db4 .owl-nav a:not(:hover):before {\\n  border-width: 0px;\\n}\\n.inso-arrow-hover-border-on.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-cf4fd856ac53369f3d7a16715d5c4db4 .owl-nav a:hover:after {\\n  border-width: 0px;\\n}\\n.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-cf4fd856ac53369f3d7a16715d5c4db4 .owl-nav a.owl-prev {\\n  top: 50%;\\n  transform: translateY(calc(-50% + 0px));\\n  left: -43px;\\n}\\n@media all and (-ms-high-contrast: none) {\\n  .gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-cf4fd856ac53369f3d7a16715d5c4db4 .owl-nav a.owl-prev {\\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\\n    margin-top: 0px;\\n  }\\n}\\n.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-cf4fd856ac53369f3d7a16715d5c4db4 .owl-nav a.owl-prev i {\\n  padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\\n}\\n.gallery-carousel-shortcode.gallery-carousel-shortcode-id-cf4fd856ac53369f3d7a16715d5c4db4 .owl-nav a.o